<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>山西古建核心考察点（年代初核版）</name><description>核心点位及断代摘要；标记用于考察规划，开放状况须重新核实。坐标继承源 KML 的 CGCS2000 标注，请核对。</description><Placemark><name>南禅寺大殿 -忻州市五台县</name><description><![CDATA[<b>现存重要遗存年代：</b>唐建中三年（782）<br/>现存大佛殿为唐代木构；建寺始建年代不详。<br/><b>城市：</b>忻州市<br/><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=38.70137616,113.11383963">Google Maps 检索</a><br/><a href="https://github.com/ChewchewHan/Shanxi-Ancient-Architecture">档案库</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>113.11383963,38.70137616,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>佛光寺 -忻州市五台县</name><description><![CDATA[<b>现存重要遗存年代：</b>唐大中十一年（857）<br/>东大殿；面阔七间、进深四间，殿内唐代塑像及壁画。<br/><b>城市：</b>忻州市<br/><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=38.86898983,113.38717550">Google Maps 检索</a><br/><a href="https://github.com/ChewchewHan/Shanxi-Ancient-Architecture">档案库</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>113.3871755,38.86898983,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>广仁王庙 -运城市芮城县中龙泉村</name><description><![CDATA[<b>现存重要遗存年代：</b>唐大和五年（831）<br/>龙王殿为唐代遗构；五间面阔、三间进深，结构简练。<br/><b>城市：</b>运城市<br/><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=34.73040002,110.68192766">Google Maps 检索</a><br/><a href="https://github.com/ChewchewHan/Shanxi-Ancient-Architecture">档案库</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>110.68192766,34.73040002,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>天台庵 -长治市平顺县王曲村</name><description><![CDATA[<b>现存重要遗存年代：</b>五代遗构<br/>现存正殿为五代建筑；具体营建年待进一步核查。<br/><b>城市：</b>长治市<br/><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=36.38331512,113.39852253">Google Maps 检索</a><br/><a href="https://github.com/ChewchewHan/Shanxi-Ancient-Architecture">档案库</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>113.39852253,36.38331512,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>沁县大云院 - 山西省长治市沁县郭村</name><description><![CDATA[<b>现存重要遗存年代：</b>后晋天福三年（938，寺院创建）<br/>保存五代壁画；创建年代与现存各构件年代须分开记录。<br/><b>城市：</b>长治市<br/><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=36.74761579,112.57472627">Google Maps 检索</a><br/><a href="https://github.com/ChewchewHan/Shanxi-Ancient-Architecture">档案库</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>112.57472627,36.74761579,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>龙门寺 -长治市平顺县源头村北龙门山腰</name><description><![CDATA[<b>现存重要遗存年代：</b>北齐创建；现存构件跨五代至清<br/>山门金、正殿宋、西配殿五代、东配殿明、燃灯佛殿元。<br/><b>城市：</b>长治市<br/><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=36.39032077,113.62305502">Google Maps 检索</a><br/><a href="https://github.com/ChewchewHan/Shanxi-Ancient-Architecture">档案库</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>113.62305502,36.39032077,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>镇国寺 -晋中市平遥县</name><description><![CDATA[<b>现存重要遗存年代：</b>北汉天会七年（963）<br/>万佛殿为五代木构代表；其他建筑及彩塑须分别断代。<br/><b>城市：</b>晋中市<br/><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=37.28526313,112.27063797">Google Maps 检索</a><br/><a href="https://github.com/ChewchewHan/Shanxi-Ancient-Architecture">档案库</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>112.27063797,37.28526313,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>华严寺</name><description><![CDATA[<b>现存重要遗存年代：</b>辽重熙七年（1038，寺始建）；薄伽教藏殿辽代；大雄宝殿金天眷三年（1140）<br/>辽金寺院群；薄伽教藏殿壁藏、塑像及天宫楼阁为重点。<br/><b>城市：</b>大同市<br/><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=40.09145713,113.28917946">Google Maps 检索</a><br/><a href="https://github.com/ChewchewHan/Shanxi-Ancient-Architecture">档案库</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>113.28917946,40.09145713,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>应县木塔 -朔州市应县</name><description><![CDATA[<b>现存重要遗存年代：</b>辽清宁二年（1056）<br/>佛宫寺释迦塔；八角平面、外观五层六檐、内部暗层，木构楼阁式塔。<br/><b>城市：</b>朔州市<br/><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=39.56523895,113.18224669">Google Maps 检索</a><br/><a href="https://github.com/ChewchewHan/Shanxi-Ancient-Architecture">档案库</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>113.18224669,39.56523895,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>晋祠 -太原市晋源区</name><description><![CDATA[<b>现存重要遗存年代：</b>宋代圣母殿及鱼沼飞梁等；建筑群跨代<br/>圣母殿为北宋代表；需逐构件记录而非以晋祠创建传说概括。<br/><b>城市：</b>太原市<br/><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=37.70752758,112.43633639">Google Maps 检索</a><br/><a href="https://github.com/ChewchewHan/Shanxi-Ancient-Architecture">档案库</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>112.43633639,37.70752758,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>辛庄开化寺 -太原市阳曲县高村乡辛庄村</name><description><![CDATA[<b>现存重要遗存年代：</b>北宋熙宁六年（1073）<br/>大雄宝殿；面阔三间、进深六架椽，殿内宋代壁画。<br/><b>城市：</b>太原市<br/><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=38.18914019,112.69243294">Google Maps 检索</a><br/><a href="https://github.com/ChewchewHan/Shanxi-Ancient-Architecture">档案库</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>112.69243294,38.18914019,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>广胜寺 -临汾市洪洞县</name><description><![CDATA[<b>现存重要遗存年代：</b>元泰定元年（1324）水神庙壁画；飞虹塔为明代<br/>上寺、下寺分开考察；切勿将明代飞虹塔误写为元代。<br/><b>城市：</b>临汾市<br/><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=36.29754267,111.80135135">Google Maps 检索</a><br/><a href="https://github.com/ChewchewHan/Shanxi-Ancient-Architecture">档案库</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>111.80135135,36.29754267,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>永乐宫 - 山西省运城市芮城县</name><description><![CDATA[<b>现存重要遗存年代：</b>元泰定二年（1325）三清殿壁画；至正十八年（1358）纯阳殿壁画<br/>1958—1966年因水利工程整体搬迁；壁画题记为重要断代依据。<br/><b>城市：</b>运城市<br/><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=34.72192803,110.68762448">Google Maps 检索</a><br/><a href="https://github.com/ChewchewHan/Shanxi-Ancient-Architecture">档案库</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>110.68762448,34.72192803,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>小西天千佛庵 - 山西省临汾市隰县</name><description><![CDATA[<b>现存重要遗存年代：</b>明代悬塑<br/>千佛庵的悬塑为明代艺术遗存；需分开记录寺院沿革与塑像年代。<br/><b>城市：</b>临汾市<br/><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=36.70145075,110.92699969">Google Maps 检索</a><br/><a href="https://github.com/ChewchewHan/Shanxi-Ancient-Architecture">档案库</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>110.92699969,36.70145075,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>天龙山石窟（博物馆） -太原市晋源区</name><description><![CDATA[<b>现存重要遗存年代：</b>北魏末/东魏至北齐、隋、唐<br/>25窟、500余尊造像；石窟艺术而非木构寺院。<br/><b>城市：</b>太原市<br/><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=37.73320547,112.37121868">Google Maps 检索</a><br/><a href="https://github.com/ChewchewHan/Shanxi-Ancient-Architecture">档案库</a>]]></description><Point><coordinates>112.37121868,37.73320547,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>